Hi!

cpufrequtils-001 (which is newer than cpufrequtils-0.4) is released and
available at

http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/utils/kernel/cpufreq/

See also:
http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/utils/kernel/cpufreq/cpufrequtils.html

The most important change in this release is that the building does no
longer depend on the autotools but on plain Makefiles. Thanks for all the
input I received following the release of the RFC tarball 0.5-pre1.

	Dominik
